---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Technology | Built By Raza"
  description="Technology, networking, cloud and AI infrastructure projects and learning from Built By Raza."
>



  

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="eyebrow">TECHNOLOGY</p>

          <h1>
            Two decades of networking.
            The next chapter is cloud and AI infrastructure.
          </h1>

          <p class="intro">
            This is where I document the technologies I work with,
            architectures I design and the areas I’m actively learning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="section-label">AREAS OF FOCUS</p>
          <h2>What I work on.</h2>

          <div class="grid">
            <article class="card">
              <p class="number">01</p>
              <h3>Solutions Architecture</h3>
              <p>
                Turning business and technical requirements into practical,
                scalable infrastructure solutions.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <p class="number">02</p>
              <h3>Networking</h3>
              <p>
                IP networking, routing, service-provider infrastructure,
                connectivity and network architecture.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <p class="number">03</p>
              <h3>Cloud</h3>
              <p>
                AWS architecture, hybrid cloud, cloud networking and
                infrastructure design.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <p class="number">04</p>
              <h3>AI Infrastructure</h3>
              <p>
                GPU networking, RoCE, InfiniBand, scale-out fabrics and
                modern AI data-center architecture.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <p class="number">05</p>
              <h3>Automation</h3>
              <p>
                Infrastructure as Code, Terraform and tools that make
                infrastructure repeatable and easier to operate.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">CURRENTLY LEARNING</p>
            <h2>Building the next layer.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="learning-list">
            <div>AWS Solutions Architecture</div>
            <div>Terraform</div>
            <div>Kubernetes Networking</div>
            <div>AI Infrastructure Networking</div>
            <div>GPU Fabrics</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">THE APPROACH</p>
            <h2>Learn it. Build it. Break it. Explain it.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="copy">
            <p>
              I learn best by building real systems and testing how they behave.
            </p>

            <p>
              The projects documented here are intended to show not only what
              I’ve studied, but how I think about architecture, trade-offs,
              failure scenarios and design decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    
  


<style>
  

  .container {
    width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 120px 0 110px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 18px 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.7rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 20px;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 95px 0;
  }

  .alt {
    background: #f7f7f8;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .card {
    min-height: 250px;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: white;
  }

  .number {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #9ca3af;
  }

  .card p:last-child {
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .learning-list {
    border-top: 1px solid #d1d5db;
  }

  .learning-list div {
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .copy p {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .grid,
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .split {
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
</BaseLayout>